<title>UK: C&amp;W gains after Merrill recommendation.</title>
<headline>C&amp;W gains after Merrill recommendation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in telecommunications group Cable &amp; Wireless Plc rose on Tuesday, extending Monday's rebound as telecoms analysts at Merrill Lynch named it their &quot;focus&quot; pick for 1997, traders said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 5-1/2p at 456 by 1504 GMT in active trade of 5.9 million shares, after on Monday rising 13p.</p>
<p>Analysts at Merrill were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
